# ── curl / manual e2e scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Eleven of these were committed on 2026-10-02 and contained live
# Set-Cookie: tracksphere_session values plus plaintext passwords. They were
# removed from the working tree but the root commit was never rewritten, so
# they stayed fetchable on the public remote. .gitignore does not protect
# already-committed files — see AUDIT-2026-10-04.md section 0.1.
*-headers.txt
*-cookies.txt
curl-*.txt
# Root-anchored: these names are too generic to ignore repo-wide without
# risking a legitimate future file.
c[0-9].txt
/a.json
/b.json
/r.json
/login.json
/reg.json
/reg-headers.txt
/lh.txt
/rh.txt
